! EOM-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Closes a referee-visible hole: the manuscript's ladder quotes EOM-CCSD at
# 333.29 nm from a 6-31G calculation while every other row is def2-SVP, so the
# table as printed mixes bases. Same 32-atom neutral model as the rest of the
# ladder. Previous attempt died on disk exhaustion, not physics.
%maxcore 5000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  MaxIter 200
  NDav 400
end
* xyzfile 0 1 neutral_chromophore.xyz
